STOP-and-ack hygiene. Three potential concerns flagged + cleared
before authoring: (1) killswitch share-vs-separate (flush-instr
overrode to separate); (2) engagement-frequency uncertainty
(documented in BOOT.md + commit message; wave-35 measurement is the
